<http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/bibo#Journal> iao:0000112 "Articles usually contain abstracts and bibliographies. Includes peer-reviewed, non-peer-reviewed, and open access journals. Journals are usually indexed in the major academic databases such as PubMed and Web of Science.",
