                                                           "Rol de Presentador"@es;
                                                rdfs:subClassOf <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/obo/bfo#BFO_0000023>.
<http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/vivo#PrimaryPosition> iao:0000112 "A position designated as primary by the organization or group where it is held. This designation may be applied to zero or more of an agent's positions and may be asserted in conjunction with other subclasses of position.";
                                                  iao:0000115 "A position designated as primary by the organization where it is held.";
                                                  a owl:Class;
                                                  rdfs:label "Posición Primaria"@es,
                                                             "Primary Position"@en;
                                                  rdfs:subClassOf <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/vivo#Position>.
<http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/vivo#PrincipalInvestigatorRole> iao:0000115 "Role of a person to direct a project or activity being supported by an Agreement (for example, a grant), and who is accountable to the grantee for the proper conduct of the project or activity. Also known as Program Director or Project Director.";
                                                            a owl:Class;
                                                            rdfs:label "Principal Investigator Role"@en,
                                                                       "Rol de Investigador Principal"@es;
                                                            rdfs:subClassOf <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/vivo#InvestigatorRole>.
<http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/vivo#Project> iao:0000112 "An endeavor, frequently collaborative, that occurs over a finite period of time and is intended to achieve a particular aim.";
                                          iao:0000115 "An endeavor, frequently collaborative, that occurs over a finite period of time and is intended to achieve a particular aim.";
                                          a owl:Class;
                                          rdfs:comment "A vivo:Project is an entity imported from VIVO and extended according to CERIF specification. It can be defined as – a project in business and science is typically defined as a collaborative enterprise, frequently involving research or design, that is carefully planned to achieve a particular aim. Its configuration is inspired by the swrc:project and takes into account cerif:Project’s data properties. It encompasses all those properties and adds object properties roh:projectStatus (roh:Closed, roh:Open, roh:ProposalSubmitted, roh:Rejected) and roh:foreseenJustificationDate. This entity is linked with classes Organization, Person, ResearchObject, Funding, Expense, Activity o Concept. A project in ROH may require ethical validation which is expressed as roh:needsEthicalValidation set to true. A project might be correspond to a research project categorized through roh:ProjectClassification by means of object property roh:hasProjectClassification or correspond to some grant associated to human resources (roh:HRClassification) associated through roh:hasHRClassification. Notice that a project is a proposal (PROPOSAL_SUBMITTED) until it passes to the OPEN or REJECTED status. When the project finishes it state passes to CLOSED.";
                                          rdfs:label "Project"@en,
                                                     "Proyecto"@es;
                                          rdfs:subClassOf [owl:onProperty <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/vivo#relates> ; 
                                                           owl:allValuesFrom <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/obo/bfo#BFO_0000023> ; 
                                                           a owl:Restriction],
                                                          [owl:onProperty <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/vivo#freetextKeyword> ; 
                                                           owl:allValuesFrom xsd:string ; 
                                                           a owl:Restriction],
                                                          [owl:onProperty roh:foreseenJustificationDate ; 
                                                           owl:allValuesFrom <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/vivo#DateTimeValue> ; 
                                                           a owl:Restriction],
                                                          [owl:someValuesFrom <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/vivo#DateTimeInterval> ; 
                                                           owl:onProperty <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/vivo#dateTimeInterval> ; 
                                                           a owl:Restriction],
                                                          [owl:someValuesFrom [owl:unionOf (roh:Closed
                                                                                            roh:Open
                                                                                            roh:ProposalSubmitted
                                                                                            roh:Rejected) ; 
                                                                               a owl:Class] ; 
                                                           owl:onProperty roh:projectStatus ; 
                                                           a owl:Restriction],
                                                          [owl:onProperty roh:fundedBy ; 
                                                           owl:allValuesFrom roh:FundingProgram ; 
                                                           a owl:Restriction],
                                                          [owl:onProperty <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/vivo#dateTimeInterval> ; 
                                                           owl:maxCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ; 
                                                           a owl:Restriction],
                                                          [owl:someValuesFrom xsd:string ; 
                                                           owl:onProperty roh:title ; 
                                                           a owl:Restriction],
                                                          [owl:onProperty roh:hasHRClassification ; 
                                                           owl:allValuesFrom [owl:intersectionOf (<http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/skos#Concept>
                                                                                                  [owl:someValuesFrom roh:HRClassification ; 
                                                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/skos#inScheme> ; 
                                                                                                  a owl:Restriction]) ; 
                                                                              a owl:Class] ; 
                                                           a owl:Restriction],
                                                          [owl:onProperty roh:participates ; 
                                                           owl:allValuesFrom roh:Activity ; 
                                                           a owl:Restriction],
                                                          [owl:onProperty <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/vivo#relatedBy> ; 
                                                           owl:allValuesFrom [owl:unionOf (roh:Dossier
                                                                                           roh:EthicalReport
                                                                                           roh:Justification) ; 
                                                                              a owl:Class] ; 
                                                           a owl:Restriction],
                                                          [owl:onProperty <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/vivo#description> ; 
                                                           owl:allValuesFrom rdfs:Literal ; 
                                                           a owl:Restriction],
                                                          [owl:onProperty roh:hasContract ; 
                                                           owl:allValuesFrom roh:ProjectContract ; 
                                                           a owl:Restriction],
                                                          [owl:onProperty roh:needsEthicalValidation ; 
                                                           owl:allValuesFrom xsd:boolean ; 
                                                           a owl:Restriction],
                                                          [owl:onProperty <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/vivo#identifier> ; 
                                                           owl:allValuesFrom rdfs:Literal ; 
                                                           a owl:Restriction],
                                                          [owl:onProperty <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/obo/ro#BFO_0000051> ; 
                                                           owl:allValuesFrom <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/vivo#Project> ; 
                                                           a owl:Restriction],
                                                          [owl:onProperty roh:isSupportedBy ; 
                                                           owl:allValuesFrom roh:Funding ; 
                                                           a owl:Restriction],
                                                          [owl:onProperty <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/vivo#abbreviation> ; 
                                                           owl:allValuesFrom rdfs:Literal ; 
                                                           a owl:Restriction],
                                                          [owl:onProperty roh:produces ; 
                                                           owl:allValuesFrom roh:ResearchObject ; 
                                                           a owl:Restriction],
                                                          [owl:onProperty roh:modality ; 
                                                           owl:allValuesFrom xsd:string ; 
                                                           a owl:Restriction],
                                                          [owl:someValuesFrom <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/obo/bfo#BFO_0000023> ; 
                                                           owl:onProperty <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/vivo#relates> ; 
                                                           a owl:Restriction],
                                                          [owl:onProperty <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/geonames#locatedIn> ; 
                                                           owl:allValuesFrom <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/geonames#Feature> ; 
                                                           a owl:Restriction],
                                                          [owl:onProperty <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/vivo#dateTimeInterval> ; 
                                                           owl:allValuesFrom <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/vivo#DateTimeInterval> ; 
                                                           a owl:Restriction],
                                                          <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/obo/bfo#BFO_0000015>,
                                                          [owl:onProperty roh:title ; 
                                                           owl:allValuesFrom xsd:string ; 
                                                           a owl:Restriction],
                                                          [owl:onProperty roh:spends ; 
                                                           owl:allValuesFrom roh:ProjectExpense ; 
                                                           a owl:Restriction],
                                                          [owl:onProperty roh:hasKnowledgeArea ; 
                                                           owl:allValuesFrom [owl:intersectionOf (<http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/skos#Concept>
                                                                                                  [owl:someValuesFrom roh:KnowledgeArea ; 
                                                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/skos#inScheme> ; 
                                                                                                  a owl:Restriction]) ; 
                                                                              a owl:Class] ; 
                                                           a owl:Restriction],
                                                          [owl:onProperty roh:projectStatus ; 
                                                           owl:allValuesFrom [owl:unionOf (roh:Closed
                                                                                           roh:Open
                                                                                           roh:ProposalSubmitted
                                                                                           roh:Rejected) ; 
                                                                              a owl:Class] ; 
                                                           a owl:Restriction],
                                                          [owl:onProperty roh:hasProjectClassification ; 
                                                           owl:allValuesFrom [owl:intersectionOf (<http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/skos#Concept>
                                                                                                  [owl:someValuesFrom roh:ProjectClassification ; 
                                                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/skos#inScheme> ; 
                                                                                                  a owl:Restriction]) ; 
                                                                              a owl:Class] ; 
                                                           a owl:Restriction].
<http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/vivo#Relationship> iao:0000112 "functions as an n-ary predicate";
                                               iao:0000115 "a reified relationship";
                                               a owl:Class;
                                               rdfs:label "Relación"@es,
                                                          "Relationship"@en.
<http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/vivo#ResearchProposal> iao:0000115 "A proposal for a research grant that has been submitted but not approved; does not represent an existing activity";
                                                   a owl:Class;
                                                   rdfs:label "Propuesta de Investigación"@es,
                                                              "Research Proposal"@en;
