                                                                                       a owl:Class] ; 
                                                                    a owl:Restriction],
                                                                   <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/bibo#Report>.
<http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/vivo#ResearcherRole> iao:0000112 "Examples of research can be seen at: http://www.ufl.edu/research/products/index.html.  Note these may have been funded, but the research doesn't have to be funded.  Also, the research may be linked to an Agreement (for example, a Grant), but does not need to be.";
                                                 iao:0000115 "A role of conducting funded or unfunded research,  sometimes linked to an Agreement.";
                                                 a owl:Class;
                                                 rdfs:label "Researcher Role"@en,
                                                            "Rol de Investigador"@es;
                                                 rdfs:subClassOf <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/obo/bfo#BFO_0000023>.
<http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/vivo#ReviewerRole> iao:0000112 "A role that encompasses both ongoing reviewer responsibility for a bibo:Collection, such as a Journal or Series, and also a review performed for a bibo:Document, such as a book, academic article or conference paper.";
                                               iao:0000115 "A role that encompasses both ongoing reviewer responsibility for a bibo:Collection, such as a Journal or Series, and also a review performed for a bibo:Document, such as a book, academic article or conference paper.";
                                               a owl:Class;
                                               rdfs:label "Reviewer Role"@en,
                                                          "Rol de Revisor"@es;
                                               rdfs:subClassOf <http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/obo/bfo#BFO_0000023>.
<http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/vivo#TeacherRole> iao:0000115 "A role of serving as an educator";
