<http://w3id.org/roh/mirror/vivo#University> iao:0000112 "University of Florida; Washington University in St. Louis",
                                                         "Definition taken from: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/University";
                                             iao:0000115 "An institution of higher education and research, which grants academic degrees in a variety of subjects, and provides both undergraduate education and postgraduate education.";
